# PX4 parameters laid over the benchmark's set when a profile has a `vision_yaw` block (the
# runners do this themselves): EKF2 takes its heading from the vision stream's attitude, which
# the bridge sends turned by the scripted heading error (sim2real/estimate_bridge/vision_yaw.py,
# docs/heading-error.md).
#
# EKF2_EV_CTRL 15: fuse EV horizontal position, vertical position, 3D velocity and yaw (7 plus
#   bit 3). With vision yaw active EKF2 stops using the compass for heading and fuses the
#   positions, sent in MAV_FRAME_LOCAL_NED, as they are.
1	1	EKF2_EV_CTRL	15	6
